\whitespace trim

A collection of web fonts for TiddlyWiki, fully self-contained: each typeface is a stylesheet tiddler (`$:/fonts/<Name>`, tagged ''$:/tags/Stylesheet'') holding a &nbsp;`@font-face`&nbsp; rule with the font embedded in base64 — no network request, works offline and in single-file wikis.

! Usage

Once the plugin is installed, every bundled typeface is available to any CSS in the wiki. Reference it by name with &nbsp;`font-family`&nbsp;, e.g. in a stylesheet tiddler:

```css
.tc-tiddler-title { font-family: "Lobster"; }
```

Or inline in wikitext:

```
@@font-family:"Caveat Brush";Some fancy text@@
```

